    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32005" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκθερᾰπεύω</span></b> , strengthd. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεραπεύω</span>: <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>cure perfectly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.88.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Agath.
				1.15
			</span></i> :—
				Med.
			, <i>get oneself quite cured,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				3.83
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>gain over,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.169
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				14.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sol.</u>
				31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				6.614.5
			</span></i><span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Agath.
				<u>Praef.</u>
				p.137D.
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰς φιλανθρωπίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					5.76
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρὰ τῶν κληρονόμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Cod.Just.</u>
					1.3.45.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be complied with,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
				5.10
			</span></i>.</div>
